title: Analytics › Arrive and read the page
route: /analytics
intro: One page. A header with the report button and one quiet note, a row of three filters, four key figures, four cards (three charts and the workload), then a heading 'Detailed breakdowns' over three folded sections. It opens on 'This quarter', 'All payers' and 'All programs'. Everything is read-only except the filters, the 'Monthly report' button and the rows of the denial table.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: the figures are modeled from invented tables. 'This quarter, all payers, all programs' is the fixed starting set (71% approval rate, 29% denial rate, 2.4 days turnaround, 207 preventable denials, 1,070 decisions). No figure on the page is a dollar amount.
---
start s1 "Click 'Analytics' in the sidebar"
screen sc "Analytics\n'Where approvals are won and lost, and whether FLO's advice is working.'\nOne quiet note: 'Modeled: ... Demo values: ... Workload and accepted denials are live.'"

group gTop "Header and filters"
  screen m3 "Button 'Monthly report' with a document icon\nIt opens a window, where the files and Print are"
  screen m1 "Menu 'This quarter'\n(period)"
  screen m2 "Menu 'All payers'\n(payer)"
  screen m4 "Menu 'All programs'\n(program)\n'Clear filters' appears once a payer or program is picked"
endgroup

group gTiles "Four key figures"
  screen t1 "'Approval rate'\n71% · '▲ 6 pts vs last quarter'\n'1,070 decisions · this quarter'"
  screen t2 "'Denial rate'\n29% · '311 denials · 17 accepted'\n'▼ 6 pts vs last quarter'"
  screen t3 "'Turnaround'\n2.4 days · 'Sent to decision · typical 1.9 days'\n'▼ 0.1 days vs last quarter'"
  screen t4 "'Preventable denials'\n207 · '67% of 311 denials'\n'Fixable before sending'"
endgroup

group gCards "Cards below the figures"
  screen c1 "Chart 'Approval rate by payer'\nSix bars, best first"
  screen c2 "Chart 'Preventable denials by reason'\nFive reasons and one 'other' row, adding up to the figure"
  screen c3 "Chart 'How people edit agent drafts'\nDonut and three-line legend"
  screen c4 "Card 'Workload'\n'8 handled', '32 still open', live from the Dashboard"
endgroup

group gDetail "Heading 'Detailed breakdowns' (all folded)"
  screen d1 "'Common denial reasons by payer'\nOne summary line\nOpens to the table, 'Appeals overturned' and 'Denials accepted'"
  screen d2 "'How FLO's advice and drafts perform'\nOne summary line\nOpens to four facts, and why recommendations were dismissed"
  screen d3 "'What helps most'\nOne summary line\nOpens to four ranked steps"
endgroup

process p1 "All figures come from the chosen period, payer and program\nA figure behind fewer than 20 decisions (or denials) is hidden"
process p2 "Nothing is stored: the address stays /analytics\nLeaving the page resets the filters"
process p3 "Other screens feed this page\nAppeal rulings and accepted denials from Denial Intelligence\nDismissed recommendations from Authorizations\nOpen requests from the Dashboard (Workload)"

goto g1 "Continues in: Analytics › Period, payer and program menus"
goto g2 "Continues in: Analytics › The four tiles"
goto g3 "Continues in: Analytics › Charts: payers, draft edits and workload"
goto g4 "Continues in: Analytics › Common denial reasons: open Denial Intelligence"
goto g5 "Continues in: Analytics › Monthly report › Open and build"
goto g6 "Continues in: Analytics › Denial outcomes and dismissed recommendations"
goto g7 "Continues in: Analytics › Preventable denials chart"
goto g8 "Continues in: Analytics › Detailed breakdowns"
goto g9 "Continues in: Analytics › Program filter"

s1 --> sc
sc --> m3 & m1 & m2 & m4
m1 & m2 & m4 --> t1 & t2 & t3 & t4
t1 & t2 & t3 & t4 --> c1 & c2 & c3 & c4
c1 & c2 & c3 & c4 --> d1 & d2 & d3
sc -.-> p1
sc -.-> p2
sc -.-> p3
p3 --> g6
m1 & m2 --> g1
m4 --> g9
t1 & t2 & t3 & t4 --> g2
c1 & c3 & c4 --> g3
c2 --> g7
d1 --> g4
d1 & d2 & d3 --> g8
m3 --> g5
